|| north | the drawing thread | eighty columns of prose that has to wrap somewhere | twenty-four | two rows | dark |     |
|unicode | a note long enough to be split across rows again |                                                            |
|| south | the reading thread | one hundred and twenty columns of prose that also wraps | forty | none | light | ascii | |
